   506                              <1> findOtherExpressionsOnLine:
   507                              <1> ;Input: rsi = start of line portion
   508                              <1> ;Output: rsi = points to first char after first ":" found
   509                              <1> ;         al = : if it was found or 00 if not
   510 00000815 AC                  <1>     lodsb
